{"unit_id":"orion-nebula-dev__dsh-Dynamic-Workflow#card-zh","repo":"orion-nebula-dev/dsh-Dynamic-Workflow","commit":"5900c6938ad8370ad38d6bf438235ddaf4c8bb20","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Dynamic Workflow（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在会话中运行可持久化和恢复的 JSON 多阶段工作流。它注册 dynamic_workflow 工具、/workflow 命令和工作流面板，按依赖顺序串行执行节点，并支持节点内多 Agent 并行、阶段角色、模型选择、状态查看、续跑和评审修订循环。适合需要拆分任务、保留阶段结果并继续处理的 DSH 用户。使用前需在会话工作区准备工作流 JSON 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:181-214","core.mjs:40-65","client.js:71-102"]}
{"unit_id":"orion-nebula-dev__dsh-Dynamic-Workflow#card-en","repo":"orion-nebula-dev/dsh-Dynamic-Workflow","commit":"5900c6938ad8370ad38d6bf438235ddaf4c8bb20","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Dynamic Workflow runs resumable JSON workflows in DSH Web. It adds a tool, the /workflow command, and a workflow panel. Nodes run in dependency order; agents can run in parallel within a node. Users can assign roles, choose models, inspect status, and resume runs. Provide a workflow JSON file.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:181-214","core.mjs:40-65","client.js:71-102"]}
