{"unit_id":"orion-nebula-dev__dsh-Dynamic-Workflow#feature-1","repo":"orion-nebula-dev/dsh-Dynamic-Workflow","commit":"5900c6938ad8370ad38d6bf438235ddaf4c8bb20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dynamic Workflow 的功能「分阶段执行」：读取 JSON 工作流并校验节点、依赖与角色定义，再按稳定依赖顺序执行节点。每个节点可配置提示词、输入、模型和结构化输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.mjs:40-65","index.js:368-398"]}
{"unit_id":"orion-nebula-dev__dsh-Dynamic-Workflow#feature-2","repo":"orion-nebula-dev/dsh-Dynamic-Workflow","commit":"5900c6938ad8370ad38d6bf438235ddaf4c8bb20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dynamic Workflow 的功能「并行 Agent 节点」：一个节点可声明多个 Agent 成员，在并发上限内分别处理任务，并将成功结果按成员 ID 汇总供后续节点使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.mjs:105-165"]}
{"unit_id":"orion-nebula-dev__dsh-Dynamic-Workflow#feature-3","repo":"orion-nebula-dev/dsh-Dynamic-Workflow","commit":"5900c6938ad8370ad38d6bf438235ddaf4c8bb20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dynamic Workflow 的功能「恢复与结果复用」：保存运行定义、节点快照和 Agent 会话身份；继续运行时验证定义与指纹，复用有效完成结果或续接原 Agent 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:368-437","continuation.mjs:44-95"]}
{"unit_id":"orion-nebula-dev__dsh-Dynamic-Workflow#feature-4","repo":"orion-nebula-dev/dsh-Dynamic-Workflow","commit":"5900c6938ad8370ad38d6bf438235ddaf4c8bb20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Dynamic Workflow 的功能「评审修订循环」：节点可设置 reviewLoop，由独立评审 Agent 检查结果，再按轮次让修订 Agent 修改；通过评审后结束，达到上限仍未通过则失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.mjs:70-105"]}
